-- 2026-11-19: "continue improving smash history in rounds, read liquipedia by hand if it's the best
-- source"): Japan's Kanto and Kansai tournaments, Apex, Zenith, Super Smash Con, Snosa, Boss Battle and
-- more. Read by hand in Matthew's Chrome from each tournament's own Liquipedia page, several seconds apart;
-- each page's 1st and 2nd checked against the names already saved (all 30 agree). Facts only (places and
-- names), credited to Liquipedia (CC-BY-SA); single-game majors' source links now point at their own page.
-- Several Japanese pages list 5th-8th as one shared place. Only fills brackets that still have 2 places or
-- fewer; safe to run twice.

